WEBVTT

01:25.840 --> 01:30.920
ADAPTED FROM A SHUQI.COM NOVEL
ORIGINAL AUTHOR: SENLIN LU

01:36.520 --> 01:39.160
The murderer slaughtered him
and didn't take any money.

01:39.240 --> 01:41.080
Do you have enemies here?

01:41.920 --> 01:44.480
We don't have much contact
with the locals.

01:45.080 --> 01:46.880
But doing business is dealing with people.

01:46.960 --> 01:48.040
How is that possible?

01:48.120 --> 01:51.160
We sell Ping'en specialty to the south

01:51.240 --> 01:55.040
and mostly deal with rural farmers
and southern merchants.

01:55.120 --> 01:56.880
We never had to know the locals.

01:58.440 --> 02:00.640
You know your family business quite well.

02:03.880 --> 02:04.720
Madam.

02:06.960 --> 02:07.800
Well…

02:07.880 --> 02:09.039
Just say it.

02:09.680 --> 02:12.560
Someone opened the side door
to Young Master's courtyard.

02:17.400 --> 02:18.400
Mr. Xiao, shall we?

02:39.960 --> 02:41.320
This place is unattended?

02:41.400 --> 02:42.640
Of course it is.

02:43.160 --> 02:45.440
But the bamboos keep dropping leaves.

02:45.520 --> 02:47.040
So it's hard to keep it clean.

02:48.840 --> 02:51.080
That's the side door over there.

02:54.760 --> 02:56.240
A tragedy happened at home.

02:56.320 --> 02:59.080
Instead of checking on Young Master,
you came to check the door?

03:00.600 --> 03:03.320
I sent someone
to check on him this morning.

03:03.400 --> 03:04.960
He's just fine.

03:06.080 --> 03:07.840
What's so special about this side door?

03:07.920 --> 03:09.080
Why did you panic?

03:15.960 --> 03:17.480
Master minded the manor layout.

03:17.560 --> 03:18.760
This door is here to gather energy.

03:18.840 --> 03:20.880
No one is ever allowed to pass through.

03:20.960 --> 03:22.440
Master even added a lock

03:22.520 --> 03:23.840
with a mechanism

03:23.920 --> 03:25.320
that only he can open.

03:27.760 --> 03:28.760
Let's check on Young Master.

03:29.360 --> 03:31.040
He's too weak to see guests.

03:40.280 --> 03:44.000
WU MUJIN, YOUNG MASTER OF WU'S MANOR

03:52.200 --> 03:53.360
Mother.

03:54.560 --> 03:56.960
Meet Fuchang County Princess
and Astronomer Xiao.

03:57.040 --> 03:59.120
They are our guests.

04:00.280 --> 04:02.480
Greetings, Your Ladyship, Mr. Xiao.

04:03.200 --> 04:05.920
May you be well, Mother.
May you find peace and solace.

04:07.280 --> 04:08.600
When did you sleep last night?

04:09.280 --> 04:11.760
Father asked me to go to bed
at the Xu hour.

04:11.840 --> 04:14.240
So early? Can you fall asleep?

04:14.920 --> 04:16.079
No.

04:16.160 --> 04:18.320
But lying in bed
and watching the bamboo shadows

04:18.399 --> 04:20.720
eventually puts me to sleep.

04:21.440 --> 04:23.200
Do you burn incense in your room?

04:37.760 --> 04:39.720
Young Master.
Did you sleep well last night?

04:40.800 --> 04:44.360
The wind and rain
along with the thunder scared me.

04:44.440 --> 04:45.280
I didn't sleep well.

04:46.400 --> 04:48.480
Did you hear anything else
apart from the thunder?

04:49.120 --> 04:51.240
I was awakened by thunder
in the middle of the night

04:51.320 --> 04:52.600
and saw a figure.

04:53.600 --> 04:54.440
Right there.

04:56.480 --> 04:57.320
A figure?

05:00.400 --> 05:01.960
It may have been too dark,

05:02.040 --> 05:03.440
but did you make out
that person's height and build?

05:03.520 --> 05:05.040
Did that person speak?

05:30.640 --> 05:31.480
Young Master.

05:31.560 --> 05:34.320
Did that person look like this?

05:44.160 --> 05:46.000
You have to be his friend.

05:57.600 --> 05:59.920
Mujin. You are amazing.

06:00.800 --> 06:01.920
Do you want to avenge your father?

06:02.520 --> 06:04.480
If you can recall
what that person looks like,

06:04.560 --> 06:06.080
I'll catch him right away.

06:11.560 --> 06:14.080
It was so dark last night.
How did you see a figure?

06:15.800 --> 06:18.440
Did the room suddenly brighten up?

06:18.520 --> 06:20.480
A big lightning bolt

06:20.560 --> 06:22.800
made my room brighter than in the day.

06:23.440 --> 06:25.040
So you did see that person.

06:27.720 --> 06:30.800
I… I was going to see who that person was.

06:30.880 --> 06:33.120
But the thunder followed.

06:33.720 --> 06:35.360
I… I was scared.

06:35.440 --> 06:38.840
I covered my ears and counted to ten.
The thunder finally stopped.

06:38.920 --> 06:41.360
Then, the room went dark.

06:41.440 --> 06:42.800
I didn't dare to go out.

06:44.040 --> 06:45.400
Good boy. Go play.

06:58.480 --> 06:59.960
Can you tell who it is?

07:02.800 --> 07:04.040
No.

07:07.040 --> 07:09.480
Why don't we see
any servants in the vast courtyard?

07:11.480 --> 07:14.760
This courtyard is quiet
and adopts a geomantic formation.

07:14.840 --> 07:17.120
Master didn't allow us to enter at will.

07:17.720 --> 07:19.600
Even I can't come at will.

07:19.680 --> 07:21.440
Only Mr. Zhong

07:21.520 --> 07:23.640
gets to come and go
because his Four Pillars of Destiny

07:23.720 --> 07:24.880
are compatible with this place.

07:25.480 --> 07:27.960
He takes care of Mujin here.

07:29.840 --> 07:31.280
Does Mr. Zhong burn incense in his room?

07:32.240 --> 07:33.960
I checked it for you.

07:34.040 --> 07:35.280
It also contains

07:35.800 --> 07:38.160
that… that flower…

07:42.040 --> 07:44.400
Did my uncle have
a deep affection for you?

07:45.680 --> 07:49.720
We were more like family members
rather than a loving couple.

07:51.200 --> 07:54.200
This child is not your own, is he?

07:56.800 --> 07:58.320
You figured it out?

08:00.240 --> 08:02.920
Mr. Xiao can even read the stars.
He noticed at a glance.

08:04.560 --> 08:05.560
That's right.

08:06.200 --> 08:07.920
I can't have children.

08:08.480 --> 08:10.520
Master brought him back.

08:11.880 --> 08:14.120
It wasn't easy for my uncle
to have a child.

08:14.200 --> 08:15.760
But he kept the child
in this damp courtyard

08:15.840 --> 08:18.000
just because you didn't like him.

08:18.080 --> 08:20.120
What is it if it's not love?

08:22.040 --> 08:26.040
Seeing him
does make me grieve over my misfortune.

08:26.120 --> 08:28.240
But I didn't ask for him

08:28.320 --> 08:29.880
to live here.

08:29.960 --> 08:31.320
Mr. Wu arranged for it?

08:32.200 --> 08:33.760
Mujin has always been weak.

08:33.840 --> 08:36.080
Years of medication had no effect.

08:36.960 --> 08:40.400
Then Master invited Mr. Xu
to design this place based on Feng Shui.

08:40.480 --> 08:43.919
It's said to save his life
and boost his energy.

08:46.160 --> 08:47.840
Who is this Mr. Xu?

08:47.920 --> 08:51.160
Xu Daoyin owns a manor
in Qingtan Town near here.

08:51.760 --> 08:53.440
Many people worship him.

08:54.080 --> 08:56.720
Master also set up a scripture hall
for Mr. Xu at home.

08:58.320 --> 08:59.680
Scripture hall?

09:00.680 --> 09:01.520
Let's take a look.

09:04.080 --> 09:04.920
Alright.

09:06.720 --> 09:07.560
You don't have to come.

09:08.840 --> 09:10.160
Wang will lead the way.

09:10.240 --> 09:11.480
Understood.

09:13.600 --> 09:15.520
Your Ladyship. This way.

09:21.880 --> 09:22.960
Please look.

09:23.040 --> 09:24.960
This is Mr. Xu's statue.

09:30.120 --> 09:31.640
What are these jade tablets for?

09:32.320 --> 09:33.160
Please don't.

09:35.320 --> 09:36.520
These jade tablets

09:36.600 --> 09:38.720
are tokens obtained
from worshipping Mr. Xu.

09:39.800 --> 09:40.720
How do you worship him?

09:40.800 --> 09:43.240
With money, naturally. To seek protection.

09:43.320 --> 09:46.520
These jade tablets
have all been blessed by Mr. Xu

09:46.600 --> 09:49.080
and placed here
to protect the household's peace

09:49.160 --> 09:50.200
and fulfill Master's wishes.

09:51.640 --> 09:52.760
That's quite a lot.

09:53.280 --> 09:55.000
My uncle must have spent

09:55.080 --> 09:57.480
most of the money he made on Xu Daoyin.

09:57.560 --> 10:00.120
Well, Your Ladyship.
Be careful with words.

10:02.080 --> 10:04.000
Mr. Xu, we pay our respects.

10:10.520 --> 10:12.600
Please offer Mr. Xu an incense

10:14.280 --> 10:15.760
to seek forgiveness.

10:17.320 --> 10:19.600
- He found a way to make money.
- Indecent.

10:30.640 --> 10:33.160
Y-Your Ladyship. What are you doing?

10:33.240 --> 10:35.120
You have to respect the statue.

10:39.120 --> 10:40.400
There's blood.

10:41.240 --> 10:42.240
Blood?

10:43.480 --> 10:46.120
My master was so pious to Mr. Xu.

10:46.200 --> 10:48.960
Why would he hurt him with this statue?

10:50.120 --> 10:51.200
This wooden statue is heavy,

10:51.720 --> 10:53.360
consistent with
the estimated murder weapon.

10:54.360 --> 10:57.160
The murderer hit the victim repeatedly.

10:57.880 --> 10:58.960
He must be quite strong.

10:59.640 --> 11:01.560
What Young Master saw last night

11:01.640 --> 11:04.440
was staged by the murderer
with the wooden statue.

11:05.520 --> 11:08.280
The courtyard is not on the way
from the scripture hall to the bedroom.

11:08.360 --> 11:09.520
He went by on purpose.

11:10.320 --> 11:13.160
There are many potential
murder weapons in the bedroom.

11:13.240 --> 11:15.600
But the murderer chose
Mr. Xu's wooden statue.

11:15.680 --> 11:19.200
He even went to wash it
and put it back after the murder.

11:19.880 --> 11:21.640
He left us so many clues.

11:21.720 --> 11:24.440
It feels like failing him
if I don't look into them.

11:29.840 --> 11:30.880
Are you unwell?

11:31.760 --> 11:34.640
That child's courtyard is cold and wet.

11:35.160 --> 11:38.600
With so many bamboos inside out,
it gets no sunlight at all.

11:39.360 --> 11:42.800
Does a courtyard like this
really save his life and boost his energy?

11:43.520 --> 11:45.400
Something is wrong with the layout.

11:45.480 --> 11:47.200
If he keeps living there,

11:48.160 --> 11:49.600
he may perish in three years.

11:50.480 --> 11:51.320
It's so dangerous?

11:51.400 --> 11:53.200
The same object,
placed in different positions,

11:53.280 --> 11:54.400
makes a world of difference.

11:54.480 --> 11:55.920
Peach wood stake in the Li position.

11:56.000 --> 11:59.160
Fire clashes with wood,
draining all auspicious energy.

11:59.760 --> 12:01.200
The stone blocks
resonate with the bamboo grove,

12:01.280 --> 12:02.360
unable to gather energy.

12:02.440 --> 12:05.120
Given Wu Mujin's age,
he can't withstand this layout.

12:05.200 --> 12:06.080
Wait.

12:06.680 --> 12:08.240
I remember the stone in the courtyard

12:08.320 --> 12:10.720
wasn't in the grove
but beside the peach wood.

12:10.800 --> 12:12.480
The formation has been moved.

12:12.560 --> 12:15.720
But the one who set it
never intended to protect Wu Mujin's life.

12:16.640 --> 12:18.160
Xu Daoyin deceived my uncle?

12:20.080 --> 12:20.920
I'm not sure.

12:22.160 --> 12:23.520
But someone

12:23.600 --> 12:27.040
wants Wu Mujin dead, while someone else
is trying to keep him alive.

12:30.560 --> 12:31.840
I don't believe

12:31.920 --> 12:34.680
a single stake and a few stones
could hold such power.

12:34.760 --> 12:36.640
While they can't alter one's fate,

12:36.720 --> 12:39.240
they can benefit the occupant
by creating a nice environment.

12:40.720 --> 12:43.440
This harmful layout blocks wind and light,

12:43.520 --> 12:46.760
greatly limiting vision and movement.

12:46.840 --> 12:48.800
Even a healthy person

12:48.880 --> 12:51.440
can't live here, let alone a child.

12:54.280 --> 12:55.440
I see.

12:56.840 --> 12:58.960
Gloomy courtyard. Winding corridors.

12:59.040 --> 13:00.480
No sunlight.

13:00.560 --> 13:03.400
I was there for less than a ke
and already felt a headache.

13:04.320 --> 13:08.400
No wonder the child is sickly
and no tonic ever improved his health.

13:12.360 --> 13:14.760
Mr. Xiao, are you feeling sorry for him?

13:17.360 --> 13:18.600
How do you deal

13:18.680 --> 13:21.520
with the pity for the people
involved in the cases?

13:23.400 --> 13:26.680
All cases derive from nothing but desire.

13:26.760 --> 13:28.800
Desire for love or profit.

13:28.880 --> 13:30.960
A single thought can destroy others
and harm oneself.

13:31.040 --> 13:34.240
I am only human.
How can I remain indifferent?

13:34.880 --> 13:37.200
But if you want to keep doing your job,

13:37.280 --> 13:39.880
you must learn to treat yourself
as someone else.

13:40.480 --> 13:41.760
Treat yourself as someone else?

13:43.440 --> 13:44.920
This is the method I came up with

13:45.440 --> 13:47.800
to not suffer from caring too much.

13:48.360 --> 13:49.760
When a case ends,

13:49.840 --> 13:53.120
let that version of yourself
stay behind in that case.

13:53.200 --> 13:55.120
Grieve and feel pity as much as you need.

13:55.200 --> 13:58.320
But the you right now is another self.

13:58.400 --> 14:01.440
You can stride forward
and move on to the next case.

14:03.240 --> 14:06.520
Then, when the next case ends,
leave another self behind.

14:08.200 --> 14:09.520
You are really clever.

14:11.600 --> 14:14.200
Do you ever meet the selves
you've left behind?

14:15.320 --> 14:17.920
Why would I meet them to double the pain?

14:18.800 --> 14:20.600
I'm not doing this to myself.

14:21.360 --> 14:23.440
If all the pain can be isolated,

14:23.520 --> 14:26.360
then I hope you can stay further away
from your former selves.

14:27.560 --> 14:28.960
What?

14:29.040 --> 14:31.520
I said I'll try it next time.

14:40.120 --> 14:41.440
Your Ladyship, I found

14:42.160 --> 14:43.760
the medicine dregs in the grass

14:43.840 --> 14:45.360
outside the victim's bedroom.

14:51.320 --> 14:53.400
Dang Gui, cinnamon,

14:54.080 --> 14:56.800
Sichuan lovage,
Achyranthes root, plantain seed,

14:58.720 --> 14:59.560
and safflower?

15:01.160 --> 15:02.160
This recipe looks so familiar.

15:02.240 --> 15:04.040
It's the Tuohua Decoction.

15:06.600 --> 15:08.320
- To induce labor?
- That's right.

15:08.400 --> 15:09.560
In this prescription,

15:09.640 --> 15:11.760
Dang Gui and Sichuan lovage
are blood-activating.

15:11.840 --> 15:12.840
The amounts of the herbs

15:12.920 --> 15:15.040
in the medicine dregs
far exceed the normal dosage.

15:19.160 --> 15:22.600
If the dosage of these two herbs
is not properly controlled,

15:22.680 --> 15:24.320
it could cause fatal bleeding
during labor.

15:25.000 --> 15:26.880
The Imperial Medical Office
has prohibited its use

15:26.960 --> 15:28.280
for many years.

15:29.560 --> 15:32.560
But the herbs in this prescription
are easy to find.

15:32.640 --> 15:34.640
The authorities are far away.

15:34.720 --> 15:37.200
The folk people
still induce labor with it.

15:46.400 --> 15:47.760
Something happened at Wu's Manor.

15:47.840 --> 15:49.960
Madam Wu claimed to suspect Wu Mujin

15:50.040 --> 15:53.400
and moved him out of the courtyard
and had people search the courtyard.

15:54.000 --> 15:56.080
Didn't I ask you to protect Wu Mujin?

15:56.160 --> 15:58.720
- How did this happen?
- Where did he move to?

15:58.800 --> 16:01.400
A guest room right next
to Madam Wu's bedroom.

16:01.480 --> 16:04.520
She said she'd put him
right under her nose

16:04.600 --> 16:05.880
so that he couldn't cause trouble.

16:07.840 --> 16:09.800
Why did she suddenly
grow suspicious of him?

16:09.880 --> 16:12.640
Because only Young Master's
incense doesn't contain

16:12.720 --> 16:13.680
Datura flower.

16:13.760 --> 16:16.520
Thus, Madam decided that he was involved.

16:16.600 --> 16:19.600
He's such a feeble child.

16:19.680 --> 16:20.840
How could he kill someone?

16:20.920 --> 16:22.840
Isn't this ridiculous?

16:23.800 --> 16:25.800
Let her be.

16:26.400 --> 16:27.240
Magistrate Wen.

16:27.320 --> 16:30.240
When will your messenger
come back from the Western Capital?

16:32.280 --> 16:33.600
It will be tonight at the earliest.

16:38.160 --> 16:39.120
Your Ladyship.

16:40.840 --> 16:42.080
Your Ladyship.

16:42.160 --> 16:44.320
Our years of friendship
have gone to waste?

16:44.400 --> 16:46.440
You went and found an outsider
for the investigation?

16:46.520 --> 16:48.320
Your Ladyship. Wuren insists on coming.

16:48.920 --> 16:50.240
What do you mean?

16:50.320 --> 16:52.560
- That messenger won't be here until night.
- I…

16:55.400 --> 16:56.240
Magistrate Wen.

16:57.880 --> 16:58.720
Coming.

17:00.480 --> 17:01.520
Your Ladyship.

17:01.600 --> 17:02.920
- Get me a horse.
- Understood.

17:04.640 --> 17:06.119
Your Ladyship. Where are we going?

17:07.200 --> 17:08.040
To Qingtan Town.

17:08.119 --> 17:09.440
Find Xu Daoyin.

17:22.160 --> 17:25.640
SEE SIMPLICITY AND EMBRACE PLAINNESS

17:34.920 --> 17:36.440
For the Heaven-Inquiry Ceremony,

17:36.520 --> 17:37.840
line up at the gate.

17:37.920 --> 17:40.520
We came on behalf
of Wu Siping from the Ping'en County.

17:50.480 --> 17:51.640
Distinguished guests.

17:51.720 --> 17:53.760
Forgive me. Please follow me.

18:02.560 --> 18:03.520
This way, please.

18:12.240 --> 18:14.200
Mr. Xu is preparing for the ceremony.

18:14.280 --> 18:16.920
Everyone. Please rest
in Mr. Wu's courtyard.

18:17.480 --> 18:21.000
Someone will lead you
to your seats for the grand event.

18:21.080 --> 18:22.280
Thank you.

18:22.360 --> 18:23.360
My pleasure.

18:28.080 --> 18:30.480
He has a courtyard in this manor.

18:31.000 --> 18:32.560
He's spent a fortune here.

18:33.080 --> 18:37.280
But how did you figure out
where the door is?

18:40.240 --> 18:42.680
Wu's Manor adopts a geomantic formation.

18:42.760 --> 18:45.440
Mr. Xu's manor
must have followed the same design.

18:45.520 --> 18:47.720
The manor leans against the mountain,

18:47.800 --> 18:50.040
and the layout follows the concept
of the Big Dipper.

18:50.120 --> 18:53.600
The whole manor is, in fact,
a massive geomantic formation.

18:55.480 --> 18:56.960
What about the side gate?

18:57.040 --> 18:58.280
The side gate we passed through

18:58.360 --> 19:00.640
is the Gate of Life within this formation.

19:00.720 --> 19:03.400
So there must be another exit
besides the main gate.

19:03.480 --> 19:05.880
The mechanism wins your recognition.

19:05.960 --> 19:07.480
Mr. Xu does have some skills.

19:09.720 --> 19:11.320
How do you know I took a jade tablet?

19:11.400 --> 19:13.920
I've been around you long enough to tell.

19:25.560 --> 19:26.840
Reading the stars again?

19:28.520 --> 19:31.600
I'm used to watching the stars
as soon as night falls.

19:32.240 --> 19:34.680
Aren't you tired of it
after so many years?

19:34.760 --> 19:35.840
Not at all.

19:36.400 --> 19:37.800
They like my old friends.

19:37.880 --> 19:40.280
We communicate without talking.

19:41.960 --> 19:42.880
Is that so?

19:44.560 --> 19:46.160
I want to talk to them, too.

19:48.520 --> 19:49.920
What do you want to say to them?

19:50.800 --> 19:53.280
I bet they know all the secrets.

19:54.120 --> 19:57.440
They've seen all kinds of crimes and sins.

19:58.240 --> 20:00.120
Culprits and thugs hit the road at night.

20:04.040 --> 20:06.160
I thought you could be romantic.

20:06.240 --> 20:08.280
In the end, it's still about cases.

20:10.880 --> 20:12.720
I'm not in the mood for romance.

20:13.920 --> 20:17.600
My mind won't be at ease
until I find an answer.

20:18.440 --> 20:21.480
I wonder if my father
ever told the stars his worries.

20:25.520 --> 20:27.200
Do you remember

20:27.280 --> 20:29.440
that the stars have helped us many times?

20:30.760 --> 20:33.800
Ask sincerely
and they'll offer you the answer

20:33.880 --> 20:35.480
one day.

20:39.520 --> 20:40.880
So I wasn't sincere enough?

20:42.200 --> 20:45.640
It just takes time. They may
make mistakes in their busy days.

20:49.800 --> 20:52.320
Why did you study astronomy
at the Astronomical Bureau?

20:54.680 --> 20:57.160
I became an investigator
to figure out the truth.

20:57.240 --> 20:58.640
Why did you become an astronomer?

21:03.480 --> 21:04.880
For…

21:06.080 --> 21:07.280
a promise.

21:10.680 --> 21:12.200
To whom?

21:14.840 --> 21:15.880
An old friend.

21:21.360 --> 21:24.640
It seems that you are
also trapped in the past.

21:26.360 --> 21:28.680
I hope the stars can solve all confusions

21:30.040 --> 21:31.240
and help those trapped in the past

21:32.480 --> 21:33.600
move forward.

21:44.400 --> 21:45.880
Any progress?

21:47.600 --> 21:49.080
Nothing.

21:49.160 --> 21:51.000
The manor is full of twists and turns.

21:51.080 --> 21:52.640
We almost got lost.

21:54.440 --> 21:55.960
It seems that the whole manor

21:56.040 --> 21:59.400
resembles Wu Siping's courtyard,
full of twists and turns.

21:59.480 --> 22:00.680
Why is that?

22:00.760 --> 22:02.720
Mr. Xu set up this layout.

22:02.800 --> 22:03.800
More importantly,

22:03.880 --> 22:06.200
they don't want outsiders to walk around.

22:06.280 --> 22:08.240
This place hides a lot of secrets.

22:09.360 --> 22:11.520
It should have an unobstructed view,

22:11.600 --> 22:13.760
but except for Wu Siping's courtyard,

22:13.840 --> 22:16.040
everything is covered by trees and bamboo.

22:16.120 --> 22:17.080
We can't see anything.

22:17.160 --> 22:18.320
That's right.

22:18.400 --> 22:20.040
We made a big circle along the mountain

22:20.120 --> 22:21.120
and found nothing.

22:22.000 --> 22:23.640
The manor is so meticulously designed.

22:23.720 --> 22:26.360
He also managed to earn
the deep trust of Wu Siping

22:26.440 --> 22:28.040
and make a fortune.

22:28.640 --> 22:31.520
It seems this Mr. Xu
is no ordinary charlatan.

22:31.600 --> 22:34.200
We'll see him
at the Heaven-Inquiry Ceremony.

23:02.680 --> 23:03.520
That is Xu Daoyin?

23:04.160 --> 23:07.120
XU DAOYIN

23:51.400 --> 23:53.280
Why is the ritual bell hanging in the air?

23:53.360 --> 23:54.880
What's going on?

24:00.600 --> 24:03.680
Mr. Xu is making inquiries.

24:19.680 --> 24:21.200
‪What's happening?

24:21.280 --> 24:22.560
- His head…
- It really works?

24:23.600 --> 24:26.560
First attempt to ask about fortune.

24:41.200 --> 24:43.840
Second attempt to ask about fortune.

24:49.680 --> 24:51.520
- His head is gone!
- His head is gone.

24:54.480 --> 24:56.760
Mr. Xu is quite something.

24:56.840 --> 24:58.920
Where did he go to make inquiries?

25:09.360 --> 25:11.040
He moved. He's still alive.

25:18.520 --> 25:20.120
- Oh no.
- Something went wrong.

25:23.280 --> 25:25.080
Don't panic, everyone.

25:25.160 --> 25:26.200
Please.

25:26.280 --> 25:28.120
Listen to me.

25:28.840 --> 25:30.080
Mr. Xu

25:30.760 --> 25:31.960
was summoned to Heaven.

25:32.040 --> 25:33.480
He will be back.

25:33.560 --> 25:34.840
Someone. Open the gate.

25:34.920 --> 25:37.080
Everyone, please get some rest.

25:37.160 --> 25:38.080
Once Mr. Xu is back,

25:38.160 --> 25:39.720
we will inform you.

25:39.800 --> 25:41.320
Be careful.

25:41.400 --> 25:43.240
Dear guests. Please go back and rest.

25:43.320 --> 25:44.400
Step aside.

25:45.400 --> 25:46.720
Who dares to stop the investigation?

26:07.840 --> 26:09.080
A mechanism.

26:17.320 --> 26:18.520
Such a horrible death.

26:18.600 --> 26:19.960
It was a murder.

26:23.320 --> 26:24.600
The incision in the neck

26:25.400 --> 26:26.640
is very flat.

26:26.720 --> 26:28.400
Only an extremely sharp blade
can achieve that.

26:28.480 --> 26:30.320
But the altar was in plain sight.

26:30.400 --> 26:31.440
There was no blade.

26:31.520 --> 26:33.080
Such a neat cut

26:33.160 --> 26:34.360
is beyond human power.

26:49.280 --> 26:51.280
Human head. Mr. Xiao, don't look.

26:54.440 --> 26:55.480
Who is it?

27:04.160 --> 27:06.480
This is Lady Yue.
Mr. Xu's immortal companion.

27:08.480 --> 27:11.040
I only heard that Mr. Wu
invited distinguished guests.

27:11.120 --> 27:12.880
I didn't expect it to be Your Ladyship.

27:13.800 --> 27:14.720
Forgive me for the negligence.

27:16.000 --> 27:17.960
Things went wrong at the ceremony

27:18.040 --> 27:19.520
and frightened Your Ladyship.

27:20.120 --> 27:22.000
I will handle this.

27:22.080 --> 27:24.080
Please go back and inform Mr. Wu.

27:24.160 --> 27:25.080
Mr. Wu is dead.

27:26.320 --> 27:28.040
Has Mr. Xu ever offended anyone?

27:30.560 --> 27:32.640
I don't understand your question.

27:33.680 --> 27:36.240
The Heaven-Inquiry Ceremony
connects people with the gods.

27:36.320 --> 27:38.640
If the gods are displeased,
they may punish

27:38.720 --> 27:40.520
the mortals.

27:40.600 --> 27:42.200
Save your story

27:42.280 --> 27:44.200
for those followers
who spent a fortune here.

27:44.280 --> 27:45.600
One more lie,

27:45.680 --> 27:47.840
I'll send you and this dead man
to the afterworld.

27:49.000 --> 27:50.480
Don't forget.

27:50.560 --> 27:52.800
Mr. Xu could be dead by now.

27:52.880 --> 27:53.960
Don't you care about him?

27:58.600 --> 28:01.000
This person is named Liu San.

28:01.880 --> 28:03.440
He is Mr. Xu's protector.

28:04.800 --> 28:06.040
Protector?

28:06.560 --> 28:09.320
He was merely a stand-in
for Xu Daoyin's "miracle" performance.

28:09.400 --> 28:11.200
At the start of the act,

28:11.280 --> 28:12.320
Xu Daoyin

28:12.400 --> 28:14.200
stood in front of this curtain,

28:14.280 --> 28:15.600
which had a hook on it.

28:15.680 --> 28:17.720
He put the ritual bell on the hook.

28:17.800 --> 28:19.880
The dark curtain
blended with the moonlight,

28:19.960 --> 28:21.880
making it appear as if
the bell was floating mid-air.

28:21.960 --> 28:23.960
Liu San, dressed in identical robes

28:24.040 --> 28:25.960
and wearing a face cover
matching the curtain's color,

28:26.560 --> 28:27.840
stood behind it.

28:27.920 --> 28:30.880
During the spray of molten iron sparks,
the two swapped positions.

28:31.480 --> 28:34.360
Xu Daoyin
stepped onto the platform behind,

28:34.440 --> 28:36.400
revealing his face above the curtain,

28:36.480 --> 28:39.000
while Liu San remained
on the altar as the "body."

28:40.320 --> 28:42.040
With the play of light, shadow, and smoke,

28:42.120 --> 28:43.800
to the audience down the hill,

28:43.880 --> 28:46.600
it looked like Xu Daoyin's head
had separated from his body.

28:47.400 --> 28:48.440
Xu Daoyin's head

28:48.520 --> 28:50.320
disappeared during the spray
of molten iron sparks.

28:50.920 --> 28:53.440
A moment later, blood spurted out
from Liu San on the stage.

28:54.040 --> 28:55.600
Did Xu Daoyin kill Liu San?

28:56.680 --> 29:00.480
No. Liu San was really decapitated.

29:00.560 --> 29:01.920
It's more complicated
than changing positions.

29:04.320 --> 29:05.160
This is the murder weapon.

29:05.760 --> 29:06.840
Copper wire?

29:06.920 --> 29:09.160
They didn't use a knife.

29:09.760 --> 29:10.560
Instead…

29:10.640 --> 29:13.760
Have you heard of people
getting hurt by a kite string?

29:14.280 --> 29:17.000
Some things
are more dangerous than we imagine.

29:18.080 --> 29:21.200
Both these pillars
show signs of rope wear.

29:21.280 --> 29:23.560
Although all pillars are tied
with thin ropes

29:23.640 --> 29:25.600
for gauze curtains as decoration,

29:25.680 --> 29:28.000
these two have
the most prominent wear marks.

29:28.080 --> 29:31.000
They were likely pulled by a heavy force.

29:31.080 --> 29:32.480
When the mechanism was triggered,

29:32.560 --> 29:33.960
the rope moved rapidly,

29:34.040 --> 29:36.480
and the sharp copper wire hidden inside

29:37.640 --> 29:38.960
was enough to sever a head.

29:40.520 --> 29:43.200
Someone set up the copper wire
before the ceremony.

29:43.280 --> 29:44.680
Let's check the back.

29:56.480 --> 29:57.800
This is from Mr. Xu's clothes.

30:01.240 --> 30:02.640
No blood here.

30:02.720 --> 30:04.320
So he was likely just abducted.

30:04.400 --> 30:05.720
There's more than one perpetrator.

30:06.320 --> 30:07.360
Not necessarily.

30:07.440 --> 30:08.480
The culprit could seize the moment

30:08.560 --> 30:10.920
when the guests
were distracted by the iron sparks

30:11.000 --> 30:12.320
to abduct Xu Daoyin

30:12.400 --> 30:14.040
and pull the switch to activate

30:14.120 --> 30:16.720
the mechanism on the altar
to kill Liu San.

30:16.800 --> 30:20.440
Whoever designed
such an intricate mechanism could have

30:20.520 --> 30:23.480
carried this out alone
if he timed it right.

30:23.560 --> 30:25.600
Involving more people might bring trouble.

30:26.200 --> 30:28.560
Who designed the mechanism on the altar?

30:29.760 --> 30:31.520
Mr. Xu, of course.

30:31.600 --> 30:33.720
But the mechanisms are heavily guarded.

30:34.360 --> 30:36.200
Only Mr. Xu and Liu San had the key.

30:36.280 --> 30:38.160
We've never been inside.

30:38.240 --> 30:39.800
Your Ladyship.

30:39.880 --> 30:41.200
Let's save him first.

30:41.280 --> 30:42.720
He's still missing.

30:43.320 --> 30:45.760
Once I find the killer, Mr. Xu is safe.

30:48.920 --> 30:52.040
These four guard the entrance
from the manor to the altar.

30:52.120 --> 30:54.600
Xiao is in charge of the mechanism tower.

30:55.440 --> 30:56.960
Have you seen anything unusual?

30:59.120 --> 31:01.440
- No.
- Are you sure?

31:02.080 --> 31:03.520
Xiao. What about yesterday?

31:03.600 --> 31:04.720
I…

31:04.800 --> 31:07.440
I've been here watching.

31:07.520 --> 31:09.000
I check it every day.

31:09.080 --> 31:11.800
Last night, I checked one more time.

31:11.880 --> 31:14.400
When Liu San went in with Mr. Xu today,

31:14.480 --> 31:16.200
I was watching this door.

31:17.160 --> 31:19.320
I didn't see anyone suspicious.

31:19.400 --> 31:21.760
Xiao. Mr. Xu treated you well.

31:22.560 --> 31:24.680
If you neglected your duty
and got Mr. Xu killed,

31:24.760 --> 31:26.040
I wouldn't let you off.

31:27.480 --> 31:29.440
I-I have a clear conscience.

31:29.520 --> 31:31.000
Let's meet Her Ladyship.

31:32.320 --> 31:33.280
Xiao.

31:42.000 --> 31:43.560
It's hard to hide out there.

31:43.640 --> 31:44.640
To enter the tower,

31:44.720 --> 31:46.640
they have to pass by Xiao.

31:46.720 --> 31:47.560
Unless…

31:52.240 --> 31:53.080
The incense?

31:54.080 --> 31:55.800
Yes. More Datura flowers.

31:56.680 --> 31:58.640
Xiao. Did you burn this incense?

32:02.080 --> 32:04.320
My daughter made me a repellent sachet.

32:04.400 --> 32:06.080
I never use incense.

32:06.160 --> 32:07.320
Think carefully.

32:07.400 --> 32:09.360
Were you feeling sleepy, dizzy,

32:09.440 --> 32:10.560
or a bit drowsy?

32:10.640 --> 32:11.720
No.

32:14.760 --> 32:16.000
He didn't enter the tower?

32:16.600 --> 32:17.920
None of the servants

32:18.000 --> 32:19.880
in the Wu's Manor admitted
that they fell asleep.

32:25.560 --> 32:28.320
The person who killed
Wu Siping and Liu San

32:28.400 --> 32:30.680
and abducted Xu Daoyin
is likely the same individual.

32:31.280 --> 32:33.880
This person has free access
to the manor and the Wu's Manor

32:33.960 --> 32:35.120
without drawing attention.

32:35.640 --> 32:37.120
He's either from the manor

32:37.200 --> 32:39.160
or a martial artist from outside.

32:39.760 --> 32:40.880
It's easy to find a traitor.

32:40.960 --> 32:42.680
But the outsider could be anyone.

32:45.880 --> 32:49.000
Did Wu Siping and Xu Daoyin
have a common enemy?

32:50.480 --> 32:52.800
They were all compassionate and kind.

32:52.880 --> 32:54.160
Why would they have enemies?

32:55.320 --> 32:56.360
Bad news.

32:57.200 --> 32:58.560
Lady Yue, bad news.

32:58.640 --> 33:00.680
- Someone broke into the Vitality Hall.
- Vitality Hall?

33:03.400 --> 33:04.800
It's just a place in the manor.

33:05.640 --> 33:07.960
Since someone broke in,
we have to take a look.

33:08.040 --> 33:09.080
Well…

33:10.000 --> 33:11.320
Let me take care of it.

33:11.400 --> 33:13.120
It's just a trivial matter.

33:13.200 --> 33:15.000
Nothing is trivial here.

33:15.080 --> 33:16.440
The killer is still at large,

33:16.520 --> 33:18.200
likely waiting to do more evil.

33:18.800 --> 33:21.480
Keep looking for Xu Daoyin.
We'll go to the Vitality Hall.

33:26.800 --> 33:28.920
VITALITY HALL

33:29.000 --> 33:31.440
The Vitality Hall
mostly houses young women.

33:31.520 --> 33:32.560
This may be inconvenient.

33:32.640 --> 33:33.520
Please stay.

33:57.800 --> 34:00.080
Won't you ask about it? Someone broke in.

34:03.880 --> 34:05.440
Liu discovered it.

34:05.520 --> 34:07.480
But that person has run away.

34:07.560 --> 34:09.000
What about the baby?

34:09.800 --> 34:12.159
It was a bit of a shock. Nothing serious.

34:18.199 --> 34:19.199
Scared, huh?

34:20.080 --> 34:21.880
Tell me everything. I'll do you justice.

34:34.560 --> 34:36.199
Be quiet.

34:36.280 --> 34:37.120
Be quiet.

34:37.199 --> 34:38.199
Don't shout.

34:38.719 --> 34:39.840
‪-Be quiet.
‪-Okay.

34:42.880 --> 34:44.760
Come with me. I won't hurt you.

34:46.280 --> 34:48.199
Be quiet. Be quiet.

34:56.600 --> 34:58.560
Help. Help.

35:00.320 --> 35:01.160
What's wrong?

35:03.160 --> 35:03.960
Get him.

35:17.560 --> 35:18.680
So deep.

35:20.920 --> 35:21.880
Trace the blood.

35:32.800 --> 35:33.800
There's blood here.

35:34.360 --> 35:35.280
Still wet.

35:39.080 --> 35:40.080
Here too.

35:40.720 --> 35:42.320
He ran that way.

35:42.400 --> 35:43.360
Let's go.

35:48.120 --> 35:48.960
You took medication?

35:51.560 --> 35:53.120
To calm the nerves and protect the baby.

35:53.200 --> 35:55.000
We have it all the time.

36:04.560 --> 36:05.680
No.

36:06.360 --> 36:07.640
What do you smell?

36:09.680 --> 36:11.440
There are too many smells in this room.

36:13.680 --> 36:15.200
Fine, rest first.

36:21.920 --> 36:23.920
Why are there so many pregnant women here?

36:25.240 --> 36:26.760
Mr. Xu took them in.

36:27.280 --> 36:28.920
Some women come from poor families.

36:29.000 --> 36:31.880
Some were unmarried but got pregnant.

36:32.480 --> 36:33.600
For some reason,

36:33.680 --> 36:35.920
they couldn't have the baby at home.

36:36.000 --> 36:37.920
Mr. Xu took these poor women in

36:38.960 --> 36:40.520
and found good people

36:40.600 --> 36:42.200
to adopt their children.

36:43.800 --> 36:45.320
Xu Daoyin was too kind

36:45.840 --> 36:47.240
to just take in these few, right?

36:48.080 --> 36:52.200
Orphans, the elderly, homeless people,
those with illnesses or disabilities.

36:52.280 --> 36:53.480
They all need shelter.

36:54.040 --> 36:55.280
Can this manor really house so many?

36:56.800 --> 36:59.440
Mr. Xu also took care of those people.

36:59.520 --> 37:01.360
He just didn't
accommodate them in the manor.

37:03.080 --> 37:04.240
So he was kinder

37:04.320 --> 37:06.280
to a certain group of people.

37:14.920 --> 37:16.080
Have you mobilized everyone?

37:16.160 --> 37:18.160
Be sure to find Mr. Xu
before Her Ladyship.

37:18.240 --> 37:20.880
Everyone is out. Dead or alive.

37:23.440 --> 37:25.920
Don't make any mistakes
about the delivery tonight.

37:26.000 --> 37:28.600
We're all set. Nothing will go wrong.

37:30.440 --> 37:32.000
Pack up everything.

37:32.840 --> 37:33.920
If Mr. Xu really…

37:34.000 --> 37:35.360
Rest assured.

37:36.000 --> 37:38.640
I've contacted the boat
leaving Qingtan Town.

37:39.200 --> 37:40.560
If Mr. Xu is dead,

37:40.640 --> 37:43.040
we'll wrap up this deal tonight

37:43.120 --> 37:44.760
and get out of this manor

37:44.840 --> 37:46.560
within an hour.

37:52.920 --> 37:54.040
He got away.

37:54.880 --> 37:55.840
We deserve punishment.

37:56.800 --> 37:58.200
It's understandable.

37:59.480 --> 38:01.760
This manor seems to have
many secret passages.

38:01.840 --> 38:03.080
Xu Daoyin is not the only one

38:03.840 --> 38:05.320
who masters mechanical techniques.

38:06.600 --> 38:07.680
Your Ladyship.

38:15.400 --> 38:17.240
Lady Yue prepared a meal for you.

38:20.920 --> 38:22.880
She's so thoughtful. Thank her for me.

38:23.640 --> 38:25.440
She is grateful for your help

38:25.520 --> 38:28.160
and told us to look after you.

38:28.240 --> 38:31.160
The servants are at the door.
Tell us if you need anything.

38:33.280 --> 38:34.880
It's wise to be cautious of people.

38:34.960 --> 38:36.520
Xu Daoyin's immortal companion

38:36.600 --> 38:37.920
can't be a simple woman.

38:38.000 --> 38:40.680
It seems tonight
is destined to be restless.

38:40.760 --> 38:42.240
How do you know?

38:43.760 --> 38:44.960
Persimmon.

38:47.040 --> 38:49.440
I don't know whether it's good or bad.

39:33.440 --> 39:34.280
Anything bothering you?

39:35.840 --> 39:36.680
No.

39:37.320 --> 39:38.280
I'm waiting,

39:38.360 --> 39:39.360
just as you said.

39:42.680 --> 39:44.400
Look at the Alkaid.

39:45.000 --> 39:46.800
It's too far away. I can't see clearly.

39:49.840 --> 39:50.680
Do this.

39:51.520 --> 39:52.840
See through this.

40:06.200 --> 40:07.040
Now I see it.

40:07.680 --> 40:08.840
If waiting doesn't work,

40:09.360 --> 40:10.520
you can take some measures.

40:12.480 --> 40:13.320
Any wise advice?

40:13.400 --> 40:14.840
It's getting late.

40:14.920 --> 40:15.760
Go to bed.

40:23.840 --> 40:26.200
VITALITY HALL

40:26.280 --> 40:28.400
I am Madam Wu's servant Wu Lie.
Greetings, Your Ladyship.

40:28.480 --> 40:30.120
Please help her.

40:32.080 --> 40:33.960
Wait outside. Play it by ear.

40:38.360 --> 40:39.400
Harder.

40:39.920 --> 40:41.280
- It comes out!
- Your Ladyship.

40:42.000 --> 40:42.960
Almost there.

40:43.040 --> 40:44.400
Harder.

40:44.480 --> 40:45.440
The baby is coming out.

40:45.520 --> 40:46.720
Get her up.

40:47.560 --> 40:49.600
Why is Liu giving birth so much earlier?

40:49.680 --> 40:52.400
- She was probably shocked.
- Harder.

40:52.480 --> 40:53.320
It's bloody in here.

40:53.400 --> 40:55.160
Please wait outside.

40:55.240 --> 40:57.600
- Shocked? She should rest.
- Almost there.

40:57.680 --> 40:58.520
- Why are you pushing her to give birth?
- Almost there!

40:59.240 --> 41:00.600
Hold her now.

41:00.680 --> 41:01.880
Have the medicine.

41:03.240 --> 41:04.600
Stop it. Don't you hear me?

41:05.200 --> 41:07.120
The baby is coming out. We can't stop.

41:08.160 --> 41:09.120
Hurry up.

41:10.200 --> 41:11.040
Hold her.

41:14.000 --> 41:15.040
Beginning of the Hai hour.

41:15.120 --> 41:15.960
He's born.

41:16.720 --> 41:18.120
- He's born.
- Come with me.

41:18.200 --> 41:19.240
He's born.

41:23.160 --> 41:24.440
She's bleeding. Hurry.

41:24.520 --> 41:25.560
Hurry.

41:28.520 --> 41:29.600
Give me that.

41:31.640 --> 41:32.560
What's going on?

41:32.640 --> 41:34.040
Stop the bleeding.

41:37.000 --> 41:39.600
Your Ladyship.
Let's leave it to the midwives.

41:39.680 --> 41:41.120
- Why can't you stop the bleeding?
- Look!

41:41.200 --> 41:42.080
Hurry.

41:42.840 --> 41:44.000
It doesn't stop.

41:54.760 --> 41:55.600
She's dead.

41:59.920 --> 42:02.160
VITALITY HALL

42:06.840 --> 42:08.080
Your Ladyship is kind.

42:08.600 --> 42:10.200
Unfortunately,

42:10.720 --> 42:12.040
Liu was too weak.

42:12.840 --> 42:15.360
I don't think you care about her at all.

42:19.560 --> 42:21.000
That's a serious accusation.

42:21.080 --> 42:24.480
The Vitality Hall
was set up for the poor mothers.

42:24.560 --> 42:26.840
Of course, we care about them.

42:37.000 --> 42:38.080
Tuohua Decoction.

42:38.160 --> 42:39.120
Strong medicine.

42:39.200 --> 42:41.600
A slight mistake can make
a delivering mother bleed to death.

42:41.680 --> 42:43.560
The Imperial Medical Office
has prohibited its use.

42:46.000 --> 42:49.680
Did Liu go into early labor due to shock,
or did you induce her labor?

42:51.000 --> 42:52.880
She was the one with the child.

42:52.960 --> 42:54.120
We could only deliver the baby

42:54.200 --> 42:55.720
when she was ready.

42:55.800 --> 42:58.200
I know the Tuohua Decoction
can't be abused.

42:58.880 --> 43:00.680
But once a woman is pregnant,

43:00.760 --> 43:03.240
the child's life weighs more than her own.

43:03.840 --> 43:06.280
She told us to prepare
the Tuohua Decoction

43:06.360 --> 43:08.280
and asked us to save the child,

43:08.360 --> 43:10.080
even at the cost of her life.

43:11.880 --> 43:13.880
Since you're innocent,

43:14.640 --> 43:16.880
then why did you poison our food?

43:20.800 --> 43:21.800
No, I didn't.

43:22.440 --> 43:25.280
All the ingredients I prepared
are top quality.

43:25.360 --> 43:26.320
If you don't believe me,

43:26.400 --> 43:28.440
take the dishes
to the yamen for inspection.

43:30.200 --> 43:32.240
You're right again.

43:32.320 --> 43:34.240
Lady Yue is really skilled and bold.

43:34.320 --> 43:35.600
At this point,

43:35.680 --> 43:37.880
she can still respond calmly as usual.

43:37.960 --> 43:40.800
Roast mutton with veratrum
instead of scallion.

43:40.880 --> 43:42.800
And ginseng-infused medicinal liquor.

43:43.440 --> 43:45.720
You've mastered
the "Eighteen Incompatibilities."

43:46.320 --> 43:47.160
What a pity.

43:47.240 --> 43:49.160
I've learned from the best.

43:49.680 --> 43:52.240
She knew the food incompatibilities
much better than you.

43:57.000 --> 43:58.880
You intended to murder me

43:58.960 --> 44:01.680
and used banned drugs
to kill the woman in labor.

44:01.760 --> 44:03.440
What are you trying to do?
